# =============================================================================
#  MERA - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Tide")                      Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "Mera_Idle" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "Mera_Idle" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s = one slow tide - fluid, regal, commanding
#    0-70     : arms soft at her sides, palms a little open; a slow swell ripples up her spine (hips -> chest -> head)
#    70-130   : she SUMMONS the water - arms rise forward to chest height, chest lifts, knees ease up, chin lifts
#    130-246  : she CONDUCTS the current - both arms sweep left, right, left across the front (the left follows the right
#               by 10 f); each arm ripples like water (shoulder -> elbow 0.9 rad later -> wrist 1.8 rad later);
#               hips lean against the sweep (S-curve) and her head follows the current
#    246-300  : the wave CRASHES - arms sweep down and wide, the chest folds, knees sink, an exhale; wrists open in a flourish
#    300-360  : the tide ebbs - arms settle at her sides, posture returns, chin up
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.
# =============================================================================
